  <tag code="1.2" vocabulary="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.2 - By 2030, reduce at least by half the proportion of men, women and children of all ages living in poverty in all its dimensions according to national definitions.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1.2 - Till 2030 minst halvera den andel m&#xe4;n, kvinnor och barn i alla &#xe5;ldrar som lever i n&#xe5;gon form av fattigdom enligt nationella definitioner.</narrative>
  </tag>
  <tag code="13.1" vocabulary="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">13.1 - Strengthen resilience and adaptive capacity to climate-related hazards and natural disasters in all countries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">13.1 - St&#xe4;rka motst&#xe5;ndskraften mot och f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;gan till anpassning till klimatrelaterade faror och naturkatastrofer i alla l&#xe4;nder.</narrative>
  </tag>
  <tag code="5.5" vocabulary="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">5.5 - Ensure women&#x2019;s full and effective participation and equal opportunities for leadership at all levels of decision-making in political, economic and public life.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">5.5 - Tillf&#xf6;rs&#xe4;kra kvinnor fullt och faktiskt deltagande och lika m&#xf6;jligheter till ledarskap p&#xe5; alla beslutsniv&#xe5;er i det politiska, ekonomiska och offentliga livet.</narrative>
  </tag>
  <tag code="6.5" vocabulary="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">6.5 - By 2030, implement integrated water resources management at all levels, including through transboundary cooperation as appropriate.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">6.5 - Senast 2030 genomf&#xf6;ra en integrerad f&#xf6;rvaltning av vattenresurser p&#xe5; alla niv&#xe5;er, n&#xe4;r s&#xe5; &#xe4;r l&#xe4;mpligt genom gr&#xe4;ns&#xf6;verskridande samarbete.</narrative>
  </tag>
  <tag code="6.6" vocabulary="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">6.6 - By 2020, protect and restore water-related ecosystems, including mountains, forests, wetlands, rivers, aquifers and lakes.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">6.6 - Senast 2020 skydda och &#xe5;terst&#xe4;lla de vattenrelaterade ekosystemen, d&#xe4;ribland berg, skogar, v&#xe5;tmarker, floder, akviferer och sj&#xf6;ar.</narrative>
  </tag>
